{"asset_key":"ep4/quest_story_14234400","episode":"ep4","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14234400","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:1:1423440001:1":{"text":"*Sobbing* Mittens is back! Thank you for bringing him home!","source_cn":"呜呜……咪咪回来了！谢谢你们找到它！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDDAD528D2DC8EDF2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1423440002:1":{"text":"Stop right there! That Mittens you speak of is my missing pet! Where did you find him?!","source_cn":"站住！汝口中所谓“咪咪”，乃吾遗失之家宠！汝从何处得来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCB81AD1DFA8952BF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1423440003:1":{"text":"What's he talking about?","source_cn":"他说的话是什么意思……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3569B133AE3B7AB7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1423440004:1":{"text":"He says Mittens is his lost pet. He wants to know where you found him...","source_cn":"他说咪咪是他丢失的宠物，问你从哪里得到的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x68DCD9517FF42D02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1423440005:1":{"text":"I found him in the bushes... he was so thin. I took care of him...","source_cn":"呜……咪咪是我在草丛里捡到的，那个时候它很瘦，我把它照...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x01EB28A4DABF34C4","variant_status":"","mal